{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1000_p", "source_sha256": "950ef32ed779db5ad2cfb242b1091607a04a5523563258a500172911fa40f2cc", "ja": "（響の新しい衣装が届いた。\nちょうど、試着しているみたいだ）", "zh": "（响的新服装送到了。\n她好像正好正在试穿。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "4c8bc969927161f6072afe07ef64a4246ba6dd40d978600eaf9f4e6365c5a877", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。衣装ありがとね！\n自分、すっごく気に入ったぞ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。谢谢你送来的服装！\n我特别喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5db4de1174d9619b8d3809105e8c6a2f0da3ff37617d1776aa9a87677eb6d01e", "ja": "ならよかった。何しろ『沖縄はいさい大使』だから、\nそれに相応しい衣装でないとな！", "zh": "那就好。毕竟可是“冲绳Haisai大使”，当然得穿与这个身份相称的服装才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2e0f5178793590520cf8d4d6ed58383046268047ef80d4bdbbe0506988233d0d", "ja": "こうして改めて見ると、南国の妖精みたいだな。\n本当によく似合ってるよ、うん。", "zh": "这样重新看一看，真像是南国的妖精啊。\n真的很适合你，嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "a4f6e25e39fc4849f93efff57cf97bb4092b6ceb7379f9891463fd4d99bd69e1", "ja": "え……そ、そう？　南国の妖精だなんて、\n自分、そんなに似合ってるかな……えへへ……。", "zh": "诶……是、是吗？说我像南国的妖精什么的，\n真的很适合我吗……嘿嘿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b65a6acc1e409ff4350815c033bb057af234dee6bafb1ed9f644af030290bcf9", "ja": "響はスタイルがいいから、少し露出度が高そうな\n衣装でも、映えるんだな。爽やかに見えるよ。", "zh": "响身材很好，所以即使是稍微有些暴露的服装，也很衬你呢。看起来很清爽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "db9cbb2bd2eeea56fb85114f1d142dfebeecb0f536beac07ffef48c3fd81ed5b", "ja": "爽やかか……えへへ♪　なんか、\nあんまり褒められると照れくさいぞ……。", "zh": "清爽啊……嘿嘿♪　被夸得太多，反而有点不好意思了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ab8ad960b05767d23f7835e61b50cfc618a9472a90ee945c15d3be5521faf218", "ja": "なんといっても、動きに華があるからな。\nファンのみんなも、喜んでくれると思う。", "zh": "不管怎么说，你的动作很有魅力。  \n我想粉丝们也会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "9099868c7374e846530cd6436956b775895c0adf79fed36323dc92da94db6e0a", "ja": "う……うぎゃーっ！　ストップストップ！\nダメダメ、それ以上は褒めすぎだから！", "zh": "呜……呜哇——！停停停！\n不行不行，再夸下去就夸过头了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b7e550fa4a46508442bda26064ce6b71dab323eba7f8e9d41b66330603b1522a", "ja": "えっ！？　響がそんな事を言うなんて……\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "诶！？响居然会说这种话……\n你这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "53ce0597d67da779ef63f6eedd9b93fa90a2a8df6f22db3e8b46dc3c06682991", "ja": "褒められるのはうれしいけど、まだ衣装を着ただけ！\n自分の仕事は、これからでしょ。", "zh": "被夸我很高兴，但现在只是穿上衣装而已！自己的工作，还没开始呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "8d12be681b6596c7e056137fa789662fe36cd7efe1853fb8de61d7c339d6edda", "ja": "だから褒めるのは、自分の仕事が\n全部終わるまで取っておいて！", "zh": "所以夸奖的话，等我的工作全部结束后再说吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7561a41318e3233aebd5963f3d985dd67035ff5451cf787e4f363cfcad619628", "ja": "そうか……わかった！　なら本番が終わるまで、\n響の事は、褒めないようにしないとな。", "zh": "这样啊……明白了！那在正式演出结束之前，就不能夸响了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "d44c1b4e3543ec74bf62b7073baa9e770cca7d917edacaf089f5c1e0a4328317", "ja": "えっ？　いや、そこまでは別に……。\nちょっとくらいなら……。", "zh": "诶？不用做到那种程度啦……稍微夸一下也没关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "a5c7fabfaf57dd3d30850cc63d84f6cc3330eeb3ae6a3411e756f425b22d5c29", "ja": "それに、みんなが褒められてるのに、\n自分だけ褒められないのってなんか……。", "zh": "而且，大家都被夸了，\n只有自己没被夸，总觉得有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "2c633a01521c66d52b71234382976cadcffe11f669f6e82035f2adeee9fef0bb", "ja": "うぐぐ……や、やっぱり今のなしーっ！！", "zh": "呜呜呜……刚、刚才说的还是不算数——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f956e95860f9171550d6418f53a6ebb54b3f8cb5f82d59dead313adc990c53a2", "ja": "響！？", "zh": "響！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0214_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "14f6ec845d7448f2273f05a027af4ddf55f0f561878a87e4f9cc781754db38ee", "ja": "やっぱり、ぜんぜん褒めてくれないのは寂しいから！\nちょっとだけなら、褒めていいからね！", "zh": "果然，要是完全不夸奖人家的话，会觉得很寂寞嘛！\n稍微夸夸人家一下也是可以的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
